s a rectangular shape with slightly rounded edges and is made of clear glass, revealing a golden amber liquid inside. The bottle's label, centered on the front, reads \"Flor d'Amica\" in black, elegant, serif font. Below the brand name, it states \"Essencia Natural 50ml\" in smaller text. The bottle's stopper is a clear, rectangular crystal with a metallic, ribbed neck.\n\nThe background features a bright blue sky with a few fluffy white clouds, creating a cheerful and sunny atmosphere. Surrounding the bottle are numerous wildflowers, including orange marigolds and white daisies, adding vivid splashes of color. The flowers are in various stages of bloom, with some marigolds fully open and others still in bud form. The bottle is placed on a large, textured rock, which adds a natural, rustic element to the composition.\n\nThe overall style of the photograph is bright and inviting, with a focus on natural beauty and simplicity. The use of natural light enhances the colors and textures, giving the image a fresh and lively feel."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 10, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [312.2679443359375, 248.2139129638672], "pos": [2880.352294921875, 858.0474853515625], "widgets_values": ["", "这是在充满活力的户外背景的香水瓶中的高质量照片。该瓶子位于中央位置，具有矩形的形状，边缘略微圆形，由透明的玻璃制成，内部露出金色的琥珀色液体。瓶子的标签以黑色，优雅，衬线字体为中心，读为“弗洛·迪阿米卡”。在品牌名称下方，它在较小的文本中指出“ Essencia Natural 50ml”。瓶子的塞子是一个清晰的矩形晶体，有金属，肋骨的脖子。\n\n背景具有明亮的蓝天，上面有一些蓬松的白色云层，营造出开朗而晴朗的氛围。瓶子周围有许多野花，包括橙色万寿菊和白色雏菊，增加了生动的颜色。这些花处于盛开的各个阶段，有些万寿菊完全开放，有些人仍处于芽状态。瓶子放在一块质地的大岩石上，在构图中增加了天然，质朴的元素。\n\n照片的整体风格是明亮而诱人的，重点是自然美和简单。自然光的使用增强了颜色和纹理，从而使图像具有新鲜而活泼的感觉。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link"